  "description": "TUnit-native text-snapshot assertions using [AssertionExtension]. Provides Assert.That(actual).MatchesSnapshot() / .MatchesSnapshotFile() with line-based diff display, accept-via-environment-variable workflow, and CI guard. AOT-compatible, trimmable, no reflection. Designed for API-surface verification and small text snapshots; coexists with Verify for object-graph cases.",
